# Prettier is the single source of truth for formatting and it writes LF.
# Normalising line endings in the working tree - not just in the object store -
# keeps `npm run format:check` and the pre-commit hook honest on Windows
# checkouts, where core.autocrlf would otherwise hand Prettier CRLF files it
# will always report as unformatted.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ico binary
